[h1]Phobos Approach Assist (Prototype) 0.1.2[/h1]
[b]Draft - not published | 2026-09-25[/b]

[h2]Development baseline[/h2]

[list]
[*]Initial changelog baseline for the current source; this version has not been published to Steam.
[*]A short test thrust pulse with prototype diagnostics and controls.
[/list]

[h2]Requirements[/h2]

Historical build baseline: Ostranauts 1.0.1.4 and BepInEx 5. It is opt-in and excluded from the default installer.

[h2]Known limits[/h2]

[list]
[*]Held historical prototype: not scheduled for Workshop publication.
[*]Not automatic approach or docking. Prototype actions are restricted to PhobosApproachAssistTest saves; this restriction does not apply to the current mod suite.
[*]Native placeholder artwork is referenced from the installed game; game images are not distributed here.
[/list]

